# OS       TRIPLET                  ARCH          TIMEOUT
macos      aarch64-apple-darwin     aarch64       .

# These special lines allow us to embed default values for the columns above.
# Any column without a default mapping here will simply substitute a `.` to the empty string

# The whole suite, four precompiles of every task on a pull request, takes
# about an hour and a half, and a pull request job may first wait up to
# TTFX_BASE_WAIT_MINUTES (20) for the master build of its merge-base.
#default TIMEOUT 240
